   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Нет, Настя, у нас не свидание.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'No, Nastya, we are not on a date.' No 'are' anywhere. Russian drops 'is' and 'are' in the present, so it's just 'at us not a date'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Ты вчера всё не так поняла.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
